===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Shining Legends|Feraligatr|20}} from the {{TCG|Shining Legends}} expansion.
*'''Destructive Whirlpool''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Rapids''' on {{TCG ID|EX Delta Species|Vaporeon ex|110}} from the {{TCG|EX Delta Species}} expansion.
